    "detailed_description": "Experience Winter War firsthand in blood-chilling detail behind the safety of your own machine gun.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou need plenty of Sisu to achieve a &quot;defensive victory&quot; in this tongue in cheek shareware game.<br />\r\nSurvive human wave attacks and tanks with the aid of your machine gun company and artillery.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCompete with your friends on the highest level reached!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay either on keyboard like a true veteran, or submit to being a descendant and play with your mouse!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n(Press C in the menu to see controls)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1. Wait for opportune moment to strike!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n2. Hail down rapidfire on your enemies unrelentlessly, prioritize threats!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3. Aim down sights only when absolutely necessary, It's a Machine Gun!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n4. Be Strong, Have Sisu!",
